    questions: [{"prompt":"Best scientific approach for this lesson (Curate two polished CER paragraphs from earlier units with revision no…)?","choices":["Use a labeled model and evidence to apply “Capstone CER Portfolio.”","Memorize the title only.","Change multiple variables at once and call it proof.","Replace evidence with a slogan."],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":"Models + evidence beat slogans.","order":1},{"prompt":"Which term is most central in Unit 10 for “Capstone CER Portfolio”?","choices":["limitation","random guessing","ignoring units/labels","systems map"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":"Emphasizes “systems map.”","order":2},{"prompt":"You find a contradiction with your first explanation. Best next move?","choices":["Keep the slogan if it sounds confident.","Hide conflicting data.","Name the broken step, revise the model, and re-check against evidence.","Erase everything and invent a new story."],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":"Revision is a scientific virtue.","order":3}],
